card.text:
Shadowstep {W}{U}{B} (You may cast this spell for its shadowstep cost. If you do, shuffle it into its owner's library at the beginning of the next end step.)
When Shifting Interloper enters, return up to one target nonland permanent to its owner's hand. It's controller loses 3 life unless they discard a card.
Basiclandcycling {2}
